WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Focus is not a spotlight that reveals everything. In one famous experiment, people watched a demanding event and missed something unexpected.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Researchers later tested people who knew that trick. They tended to see the familiar surprise,

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
yet other changes could still go unnoticed. Here is the useful distinction: learning about attention changes what you look for,

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
but it does not prove that a specific recording improves concentration.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before considering an audio program, try twelve minutes of free observation. Choose one task,

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
note your distractions, and compare the experience without claiming it measures your brain.
